## Step 7: getCacheControl — The Cache Config

```
ACTUAL CODE: src/services/api/claude.ts (line 358-374)

  function getCacheControl({ scope, querySource }) {
    return {
      type: 'ephemeral',                              // cache type
      ...(should1hCacheTTL(querySource) && { ttl: '1h' }),  // 1 hour TTL
      ...(scope === 'global' && { scope }),             // global = all users
    }
  }

  Three cache scopes:
  ┌──────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ SCOPE    │ WHO SHARES THE CACHE                       │
  ├──────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ 'global' │ ALL Claude Code users worldwide            │
  │ 'org'    │ Users in same organization                 │
  │ null     │ No caching                                 │
  └──────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  TTL (Time To Live):
    default  → 5 minutes
    '1h'     → 1 hour (for longer sessions)
```

